@page "/"

<PageTitle>synapse.</PageTitle>

<div class="welcome-bg">
    <div class="welcome-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Welcome to</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">synapse.</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Stop drowning in scattered data. Discover the invisible threads that connect it all.</p>
        <p class="description">
            Information in isolation is just noise; connected, it becomes intelligence. Our platform seamlessly
            synthesizes multiple documents, reports, and articles, using advanced AI to map the hidden
            intersections, shared themes, and overlooked bridges between them. By transforming chaotic piles of
            data into a single, cohesive, and highly refined cognitive summary, we empower you to grasp the entire
            horizon at a glance. Don't just store your documents—let them speak to one another.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
            <a href="/login" class="btn-primary">Log In</a>
            <a href="/signup" class="btn-secondary">Sign Up</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
